na l[i]br[as] 25 s[oldos] p[ro] tota[l]es? co[m]mitte[n]da, et effectuata
exige[n]da, quot[iens] c[ontra] p[re]d[i]c[t]a, v[e]l aliq[ui]d p[re]d[i]c[t]or[um] fa=
ctum fu[er]it v[e]l co[m]missu[m], et poena co[m]missa exa=
cta soluta v[e]l no[n] semel, aut pluries : ni[hi]l[o]mi=
nus p[rese]ns c[ontra]ctus, et in eo co[n]tenta suo semp[er]
robore potiat[ur] : --"""
			audit.creation.date 2026-07-09T18:23:02Z
		}
