		title.value death Pesce Girolamo 19521013
		publisher The West Australian (Perth, WA : 1879 - 1954)
		media M1536
		note {
			title Text from source
			text """
https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/article/49060359

PESCE (Girolamo): Passed away Oct. 13, 1952, at Scorze, Venezia, Italia, dearly beloved husband of Maria, loved father of Lina, Alfonso, Emidio, Assunta, father-in-law of Luigi Biasin and Gelsomino Trevisan, grandfather of Gabriella Biasin: aged 58 years.
R.I.P."""
			audit.creation.date 2021-02-24T20:08:13Z
		}
		audit.creation.date 2021-02-24T20:08:13Z
	}

