		uri C:\mauro\heritage\My Genealogy Projects\Trevisan (Dorato)-Gallinaro-Masutti (Manfrin)-Zaros (Basso)\Photos\Encounter between the Earth and the return of the Charles V comet predicted for June 13, 1857, from 'Actualites Astrologiques'.jpg
		kind image
