			stance supports
			evidence {
				information_type primary
				evidence_type direct
			}
		}
		note {
			text """
farmed approximately 200 hectares dedicated to soybean cultivation. After the area was flooded due to the construction of the Itaipu Hydroelectric Power Plant, the family received compensation for the land and had to start over.

https://www.empresaemcrise.com/post/canarana-mt-produtor-rural-rog%C3%A9rio-mazzutti-entra-em-recupera%C3%A7%C3%A3o-judicial"""
