	event E9564 {
		type relocation
		date.value.point {
			value.full_date 1981
			calendar gregorian
		}
		place.place P1498
		note {
			text """
he acquired a 500-hectare rural property in partnership with family members. Starting in 1984, Rogério began working directly in agricultural operations in Minas Gerais, eventually managing around 800 hectares. Between 1990 and 1991, the family expanded its operations by converting 1,200 hectares into soybean fields; however, a soybean cyst nematode infestation starting in 1994 compromised production, leading to the complete disposal of these areas in 2000.

https://www.empresaemcrise.com/post/canarana-mt-produtor-rural-rog%C3%A9rio-mazzutti-entra-em-recupera%C3%A7%C3%A3o-judicial"""
			audit.creation.date 2026-10-26T00:00:00Z
		}
		audit.creation.date 2026-10-26T00:00:00Z
	}

